			"notes": "## [2.0.0] – 2026-06-19\n\n### Added\n- Crab apples can now be **thrown by dispensers**, just like eggs and snowballs.\n- Added a dedicated, **deeper throw sound** for the crab apple, replacing the\n  shared vanilla snowball/egg sound so the heavier fruit reads distinctly.\n\n### Changed\n- **Updated to Minecraft 26.x** (developed/tested on 26.2). Now requires\n  Minecraft 26.1+, Fabric Loader 0.19.2+, Fabric API, and Java 25.\n- **Renamed \"Hedge Apple\" → \"Crab Apple.\"**\n- Osage Orange blocks and items now slot in **next to their vanilla\n  counterparts** in the Creative inventory (e.g. the full wood set in\n  Building Blocks, logs/leaves/saplings in Natural Blocks) instead of being\n  dumped at the bottom of each tab.\n- The crab apple now uses the item ID `osage-orange:crab_apple` (was\n  `hedge_apple`)."
		},
